    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328">

                <pb facs="0317" n="297" xml:id="pg297"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Clay.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 83.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 20, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    despatch of the 22d of August, No. 51, which gives me a very pleasing account of
                    distinguished courtesies paid to you, and to our country, by the court and the
                    naval authorities of the empire.</p>
                <p>The President is much gratified with these manifestations of Russian good
                    will.</p>
                <p>I am, sir your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cassius M. Clay,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
